<title>USA: Omaha Public 478 MW Neb. nuke seen on line Sat.</title>
<headline>Omaha Public 478 MW Neb. nuke seen on line Sat.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Omaha Public Power District's 478 megawatt Fort Calhoun nuclear power plant is expected to resume power production this Saturday, the Nuclear Regulatory Commission said Wednesday in its morning plant status report.</p>
<p>The Fort Calhoun, Neb., unit was shut down October 5 for scheduled refueling and maintenance.</p>
<p>The Fort Calhoun plant is Omaha Public's only nuclear power facility.</p>
<p>--H McCulloch, New York Power Desk +212-859-1628</p>
